# Optional cloud sync. Leave both unset and the app makes no network request at all.
# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) for local development, and set the same two
# names in the Netlify site's environment variables for a deployed build.
#
# The key is the project's *publishable* key: it is built into the page by design,
# and what a signed-in person can read or write is limited by row-level security
# (supabase/migrations/20261128000000_sync.sql). Never put a secret or service-role key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
